vit super cá¬</l><l xml:id="m-13eb06bb-d6ae-4d90-aae2-a322f9f02729" facs="#m-d201185c-063a-4a6e-b372-2b5dd34bea51" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.4</l><l xml:id="m-4290be6e-3aa3-4987-a077-cf33c57632ea" facs="#m-ab55c57b-ded8-4e3e-95bb-f8cc412778c5" label="ambiguous">1.f</l><l xml:id="m-859c1e7d-2ee3-40ce-927a-0f9d632dbd2d" facs="#m-22ac882c-25a8-4b83-809f-446c86b5213e" label="ambiguous">I</l><l xml:id="m-907ce40e-d7e3-4870-a13d-5b523063f07f" facs="#m-bc8ab79e-3302-4c28-a851-6fefce16c5dd" label="lyrics-like">put é-jus. T. P. Alle-lú-ia. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-0c128d30-3f78-477c-a1b5-975b4d5268c3" facs="#m-c97d0553-8b7b-4e19-ae37-29c186433182" label="lyrics-like">aetérnum“ mi-se-ri-córdi-a é-jus, et usque</l><l xml:id="m-b7fac2d8-7624-4ba5-95c2-2e8b2613c62b" facs="#m-05ae7e14-81ac-4742-907e-da624ec769ca" label="ambiguous">in gene-ra¬</l><l xml:id="m-11be890b-e6d7-433e-b4b9-524fb7f64ba1" facs="#m-2d110308-7fad-4fce-9717-eaaa3d2a87ef" label="lyrics-like">ti-6-nem et gene-ra-ti-ónem. T. P. Alle-lú-ia. Eu ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-c82c2c33-71b6-4dfb-80eb-ce984c946a65" facs="#m-0bda0d10-df43-45b5-9dc5-4ee4092f828b" label="ambiguous">8. Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-9dd14803-dd5d-4ac9-94cc-1b213ac904c0" facs="#m-587bae36-deb5-44ea-bdaf-c935254888a7" label="ambiguous">4.A*</l><l xml:id="m-332b5ef3-2089-4cf2-8050-3342530fdad2" facs="#m-ff39940b-ebe6-4d32-b17f-b8fde3ebc8e2" label="lyrics-like">Enedí-cam te“ in ví-ta mé-a, et in nómine</l><l xml:id="m-35f0dc24-5e5a-4e41-adbd-85c98fc80730" facs="#m-7b6938e6-b728-45ad-9970-e0fb1de7253e" label="lyrics-like">tú-o levábo mánus mé- as. T. P. Alle-lú-ia. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-f2890ab2-7f9a-43e5-80e6-2857ca0914c2" facs="#m-c511a491-eca1-4b99-bb00-569680a904d8" label="ambiguous">4. Ant.)</l><l xml:id="m-d418f648-bf60-4cd6-8eee-6c3f11a342a7" facs="#m-aca526ed-b27b-4ca0-8c70-af2d0898ec5b" label="ambiguous">5.A</l><l xml:id="m-c61891d6-0446-4258-8d46-ccae6f48f037" facs="#m-c5a12b58-3a52-4c4e-8f6b-8ce0cd7c2dd8" label="lyrics-like">ON pepercí-sti“ánimae tú-ae, propter angústi-as</l><l xml:id="m-1f4e6146-f482-40b8-9e2e-441091ae9d47" facs="#m-88cc2366-377f-4eff-822b-bb7fa5cf03df" label="lyrics-like">et tribu-la-ti-ônem géne-ris tú-i. T. P. Alle-lú-ia.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
